      },
      "text": "SCALE:\n  Blood flow: 1,200 mL/min = 25% of cardiac output at rest\n  GFR: ~120 mL/min → filters entire plasma volume every ~25 min\n  Filtrate produced: ~180 L/day\n  Urine excreted: ~1.5 L/day (99.2% reabsorbed!)\n```"
    },
