      "text": "```\nMACROSTRUCTURE:\n  Cortex (outer): glomeruli, PCT, DCT, early collecting tubules\n  Medulla (inner): loops of Henle, collecting ducts\n    Pyramids: triangular medullary segments\n    Papillae: tips of pyramids, drain into minor calyces\n  Renal pelvis → ureter → bladder → urethra"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-RENAL.md#008",
