        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Renal System",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "VASCULATURE (critical for understanding GFR):\n  Renal artery → segmental → interlobar → arcuate → interlobular arteries\n  → Afferent arteriole → GLOMERULUS (capillary tuft) → Efferent arteriole\n  → Peritubular capillaries (cortex: surrounds PCT/DCT)\n  → Vasa recta (medulla: hairpin loops follow Henle's loop — countercurrent)\n  → Venous return"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-RENAL.md#009",
