        "root_concepts": "[renal]",
        "section": "human-biology",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Renal System",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The glomerulus is sandwiched between two arterioles (both resistors):\n  Afferent dilation / efferent constriction → ↑ GFR\n  Both constrict (severe hypotension) → ↓ GFR → acute kidney injury\n```"
