      "text": "```\nBLOOD → FILTRATE must cross:\n  1. Fenestrated capillary endothelium (large pores, blocks cells)\n  2. Glomerular basement membrane (GBM): type IV collagen + heparan sulfate\n     (negatively charged → repels albumin, other anions)\n  3. Podocyte foot processes with slit diaphragm (size + charge selection)\n     Nephrin + podocin proteins; mutations → nephrotic syndrome"
    },
