      "text": "**Autoregulation** (myogenic + tubuloglomerular feedback): maintains GFR between MAP 60–180 mmHg:\n- Myogenic: afferent arteriole stretches → contracts (↑ BP → ↑ resistance → GFR stable)\n- TGF (tubuloglomerular feedback): macula densa cells (in DCT near glomerulus) sense NaCl delivery → signal back to afferent arteriole → adjust GFR"
