      "text": "```\nAPICAL MEMBRANE (facing lumen):\n  Na⁺/glucose cotransporter (SGLT2): 90% glucose reabsorption (drug target: gliflozins)\n  Na⁺/H⁺ exchanger (NHE3): reabsorbs Na⁺, secretes H⁺ → carbonic anhydrase → HCO₃⁻\n  Na⁺/amino acid cotransporters, Na⁺/phosphate, Na⁺/lactate"
    },
